    ('<text class="t" x="34" y="67">User or operator</text><text class="s" x="34" y="86">requests, answers, stops</text>', '<text class="t" x="34" y="67">用户或操作员</text><text class="s" x="34" y="86">请求、回答、停止</text>'),
    ('data-title="HRI Agent" data-body="The only user-facing agent. It reads the current camera frame and runtime state, retrieves relevant preferences, and asks one focused question when the outcome or a constraint is ambiguous.|Preference writes need explicit future-facing intent, or a yes to a dedicated memory-consent question.">',
     'data-title="HRI 智能体" data-body="唯一面向用户的智能体。它读取当前相机画面和运行时状态，检索相关偏好，并在结果或约束含糊时提出一个有针对性的问题。|只有用户明确表达今后适用的意图，或对专门的记忆确认问题回答“是”，才会写入偏好。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="254" y="67">HRI Agent</text><text class="s" x="254" y="86">the only user-facing agent</text>', '<text class="t" x="254" y="67">HRI 智能体</text><text class="s" x="254" y="86">唯一面向用户的智能体</text>'),
    ('data-title="Deterministic core" data-body="PrefMemRuntime and the receding-horizon controller own the authoritative goal, task identities, confirmation, state transitions, publication, evidence rules and loop guards.|Models propose; the host decides.">',
     'data-title="确定性核心" data-body="PrefMemRuntime 与滚动时域控制器掌管权威目标、任务标识、确认、状态转换、发布、证据规则和循环保护。|模型负责提议，宿主程序负责决定。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="504" y="58">Deterministic core</text><text class="s" x="504" y="78">PrefMemRuntime</text><text class="s" x="504" y="96">+ receding-horizon controller</text>',
     '<text class="t" x="504" y="58">确定性核心</text><text class="s" x="504" y="78">PrefMemRuntime</text><text class="s" x="504" y="96">+ 滚动时域控制器</text>'),
    ('data-title="Planner, Monitor, Validator" data-body="The Planner proposes up to three next tasks from a fresh frame, the frozen goal and the history; only the first is published.|The Monitor judges whether the current task finished, from temporally stable evidence. The Validator checks the frozen visual checklist before anything is called complete.">',
     'data-title="规划器、监控器、验证器" data-body="规划器根据最新画面、冻结的目标和历史，提出最多三个下一步任务，只发布第一个。|监控器依据时间上稳定的证据，判断当前任务是否完成。验证器在任何结果被称为完成之前，核对冻结的视觉检查清单。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="794" y="58">Planner</text><text class="t" x="794" y="78">Monitor</text><text class="t" x="794" y="98">Validator</text>',
     '<text class="t" x="794" y="58">规划器</text><text class="t" x="794" y="78">监控器</text><text class="t" x="794" y="98">验证器</text>'),
    ('data-title="Preference store" data-body="Text records plus their embeddings. Records are scoped to a user and a task, and change only through explicit memory operations.">',
     'data-title="偏好存储" data-body="文本记录及其嵌入向量。每条记录都限定于某个用户和任务，只能通过明确的记忆操作修改。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="34" y="207">Preference store</text><text class="s" x="34" y="226">text + embeddings</text>', '<text class="t" x="34" y="207">偏好存储</text><text class="s" x="34" y="226">文本 + 嵌入向量</text>'),
    ('data-title="Memory Agent" data-body="Retrieves preferences scoped to the user and task, filters them for semantic applicability, and returns either the relevant preferences or the result of a consented change.">',
     'data-title="记忆智能体" data-body="检索限定于当前用户和任务的偏好，按语义适用性过滤，并返回相关偏好，或经用户同意的修改结果。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="254" y="207">Memory Agent</text><text class="s" x="254" y="226">scoped preferences</text>', '<text class="t" x="254" y="207">记忆智能体</text><text class="s" x="254" y="226">限定范围的偏好</text>'),
    ('data-title="Observation and publication surfaces" data-body="Camera frames come in as fresh evidence; one current instruction goes out on the task page.">',
     'data-title="观察与发布界面" data-body="相机画面作为最新证据输入；任务页面输出当前唯一的一条指令。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="504" y="228">Observation surfaces</text><text class="s" x="504" y="247">camera frames and task page</text>', '<text class="t" x="504" y="228">观察界面</text><text class="s" x="504" y="247">相机画面与任务页面</text>'),
    ('data-title="Execution adapter" data-body="Either a human following the on-screen instruction, or a MuJoCo Panda agent.|In simulation, Gemma 4 compiles the instruction into a constrained pick-and-place program, SAM 3.1 segments source and target, depth grounds both in 3D, and an IK controller executes safe waypoints.">',
     'data-title="执行适配器" data-body="可以是按屏幕指令操作的人，也可以是 MuJoCo 中的 Panda 智能体。|在仿真中，Gemma 4 把指令编译成受约束的抓取放置程序，SAM 3.1 分割源物体和目标位置，深度信息把两者定位到三维空间，再由 IK 控制器执行安全的路径点。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="794" y="228">Execution adapter</text><text class="s" x="794" y="247">human or MuJoCo</text>', '<text class="t" x="794" y="228">执行适配器</text><text class="s" x="794" y="247">人或 MuJoCo</text>'),
    ('data-title="Scene" data-body="The physical tabletop, or its MuJoCo simulation with a fixed monitoring camera.">',
     'data-title="场景" data-body="实体桌面，或带固定监控相机的 MuJoCo 仿真场景。">'),
    ('<text class="t" x="504" y="347">Physical or MuJoCo scene</text><text class="s" x="504" y="366">what the cameras observe</text>', '<text class="t" x="504" y="347">实体或 MuJoCo 场景</text><text class="s" x="504" y="366">相机观察的对象</text>'),
    ('<h4>Models propose, the host decides</h4>', '<h4>模型提议，宿主决定</h4>'),
    ('<p>Blue components call a model and return typed results. Purple components are deterministic code that owns goal identity and every state change.</p>',
     '<p>蓝色组件调用模型并返回带类型的结果；紫色组件是确定性代码，掌管目标身份和每一次状态变化。</p>'),
    ('<p class="hint">Hover, tab to or tap a component.</p>', '<p class="hint">悬停、按 Tab 或点按组件查看详情。</p>'),
